{"1730590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Entropy Centre", "steam_appid": 1730590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2185130], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Entropy Centre is a mind-bending puzzle adventure where you reverse objects through time to overcome seemingly impossible obstacles and conundrums. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/48ae9c00a8669eee5f46a636821fd1f6.poster.avif?t=1785331621\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/48ae9c00a8669eee5f46a636821fd1f6.webm?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/48ae9c00a8669eee5f46a636821fd1f6.mp4?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate time to your will and solve ingeniously challenging puzzle rooms, each one taking you closer to the heart of a colossal space station in orbit of Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/284f2d574d95afcbaccea06bf0cdcbfd.poster.avif?t=1785331621\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/284f2d574d95afcbaccea06bf0cdcbfd.webm?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/284f2d574d95afcbaccea06bf0cdcbfd.mp4?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extinction level event has set the world ablaze. You appear to be the last remaining person alive. Mankind’s only hope lies at the core of the Entropy Centre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/1832f06f6f87713e5368219d25b6131a.poster.avif?t=1785331621\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/1832f06f6f87713e5368219d25b6131a.webm?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/1832f06f6f87713e5368219d25b6131a.mp4?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet ASTRA, The Entropy Centre’s most advanced technical marvel. ASTRA is an AI-powered device that can scan an object’s spacetime chronology and move it through the past. Powers include rebuilding collapsing pillars to reheating cups of tea. She’s pretty chill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/135d6a217b1880da1331a140f230fc24.poster.avif?t=1785331621\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/135d6a217b1880da1331a140f230fc24.webm?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/135d6a217b1880da1331a140f230fc24.mp4?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth behind The Entropy Centre’s imminent collapse, and the Earth’s demise, can be found at the heart of this sprawling dangerous facility. But will you accept the unfortunate truth that awaits?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/45b4b97e7f1855799af466a3dec16ca1.poster.avif?t=1785331621\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/45b4b97e7f1855799af466a3dec16ca1.webm?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/45b4b97e7f1855799af466a3dec16ca1.mp4?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deviously challenging with razor-sharp witty writing and outstanding voice acting performances, The Entropy Centre merges a brilliant puzzle game with an epic adventure.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Entropy Centre is a mind-bending puzzle adventure where you reverse objects through time to overcome seemingly impossible obstacles and conundrums. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/48ae9c00a8669eee5f46a636821fd1f6.poster.avif?t=1785331621\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/48ae9c00a8669eee5f46a636821fd1f6.webm?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/48ae9c00a8669eee5f46a636821fd1f6.mp4?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate time to your will and solve ingeniously challenging puzzle rooms, each one taking you closer to the heart of a colossal space station in orbit of Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/284f2d574d95afcbaccea06bf0cdcbfd.poster.avif?t=1785331621\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/284f2d574d95afcbaccea06bf0cdcbfd.webm?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/284f2d574d95afcbaccea06bf0cdcbfd.mp4?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extinction level event has set the world ablaze. You appear to be the last remaining person alive. Mankind’s only hope lies at the core of the Entropy Centre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/1832f06f6f87713e5368219d25b6131a.poster.avif?t=1785331621\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/1832f06f6f87713e5368219d25b6131a.webm?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/1832f06f6f87713e5368219d25b6131a.mp4?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet ASTRA, The Entropy Centre’s most advanced technical marvel. ASTRA is an AI-powered device that can scan an object’s spacetime chronology and move it through the past. Powers include rebuilding collapsing pillars to reheating cups of tea. She’s pretty chill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/135d6a217b1880da1331a140f230fc24.poster.avif?t=1785331621\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/135d6a217b1880da1331a140f230fc24.webm?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/135d6a217b1880da1331a140f230fc24.mp4?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth behind The Entropy Centre’s imminent collapse, and the Earth’s demise, can be found at the heart of this sprawling dangerous facility. But will you accept the unfortunate truth that awaits?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/45b4b97e7f1855799af466a3dec16ca1.poster.avif?t=1785331621\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/45b4b97e7f1855799af466a3dec16ca1.webm?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/extras/45b4b97e7f1855799af466a3dec16ca1.mp4?t=1785331621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deviously challenging with razor-sharp witty writing and outstanding voice acting performances, The Entropy Centre merges a brilliant puzzle game with an epic adventure.</p>", "short_description": "Think in reverse. Outsmart the impossible. A mind-bending first-person adventure where you solve ingenious and complex puzzles by rewinding objects through time.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“A must-have game that I strongly recommend to any puzzle fan”<br>10/10 – GameTyrant<br><br>“Not only the best puzzle game of 2022, but it’s one of the best I’ve played period”<br>9.5/10 – PCInvasion<br><br>“Yes, it is inspired by Portal, but The Entropy Centre is its own success”<br>9/10 – GodIsAGeek<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/835607934eb78ce7d9e28510b96b0f9f891ff7b8/header.jpg?t=1785331621", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/c28c7bc88972b9f9f2e03a8e009ae20c7c31f391/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785331621", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1730590/c28c7bc88972b9f9f2e03a8e009ae20c7c31f391/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785331621", "website": "https://www.theentropycentre.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 | AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 560 | AMD Radeon HD 6870<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7500 | AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</st